{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GJMjYEagZJRSWUqrTySvec","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nid: T-20260802-policy-schema\ntitle: \"Define the versioned rate-limit policy schema\"\nstatus: ready\nformat_version: 3\nprofile: standard\neffort: S\nbudget_iterations: 15\nagent: any\nparent: (none)\ndepends_on: []\nsupersedes: (none)\nprovenance: {\"contract\": \"TaskPlanProvenance/v1\", \"initiative\": \"rate-limit\", \"projection_digest\": \"5e6880a656be7cea80e5b6e4d881764fa82dcd46e456e34ebdf9f015ca910eda\", \"snapshot\": \"tasks/.plans/rate-limit/snapshots/5380b9e38bbed6d29dc11486834868e3c096f75f3ebfbdd7088e7f39b06ae655.json\", \"snapshot_digest\": \"5380b9e38bbed6d29dc11486834868e3c096f75f3ebfbdd7088e7f39b06ae655\"}\ntouches_paths: []\ncreates_paths: [src/rate_limit/policy.schema.json, tests/test_policy_schema.py]\nsource_note: \"tasks/.plans/rate-limit/legs/LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID.md#T-20260802-policy-schema\"\ncreated: \"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z\"\ntags: []\nowner: (none)\npriority: P2\nseverity: feature\ndue_date: (none)\nprecondition: (none)\nblocked_reason: (none)\nsecurity_class: (none)\nsource_action_item: (none)\ntracker_ref: (none)\nexecution_backend: any\nsigned_off: false\nsigned_off_by: (none)\nsigned_off_at: (none)\naccepted: false\naccepted_by: (none)\naccepted_at: (none)\n---\n\n# Define the versioned rate-limit policy schema\n\n> **Why:** Give every downstream stage one validated policy contract.\n\n## Goal\n\nGive every downstream stage one validated policy contract.\n\n## Context\n\nIntent DI-RATE-LIMIT; seam SEAM-POLICY-CONTRACT; swimlane LANE-POLICY-CONTRACT; capability leg LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID. Done condition: A JSON Schema accepts valid limits and windows and rejects invalid values.\n\nApplicable intent, capability, and evidence: {\"decisions\": [{\"id\": \"ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER\", \"owner\": \"example-fixture\", \"rationale\": \"The fixture follows the blueprint order: schema, effective policy, request 101 enforcement, then visible reason and decision telemetry.\", \"status\": \"accepted\"}], \"evidence\": [{\"claim\": \"external\", \"confidence\": 1.0, \"id\": \"E-BLUEPRINT\", \"source\": {\"captured_at\": \"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z\", \"sha256\": \"f40ed16c2898b8363dfce1c19e7c3fd539d52810d52b21faeaf59323117af445\", \"uri\": \"tests/fixtures/toolkit/blueprint.md\"}, \"summary\": \"Synthetic blueprint fixture describing the rate-limiting steel thread.\"}], \"intent\": {\"claim\": \"proposed\", \"id\": \"DI-RATE-LIMIT\", \"out_of_scope\": [\"Replacing provider-owned usage metering.\", \"Choosing production storage or deployment infrastructure.\"], \"source\": {\"captured_at\": \"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z\", \"sha256\": \"f40ed16c2898b8363dfce1c19e7c3fd539d52810d52b21faeaf59323117af445\", \"uri\": \"tests/fixtures/toolkit/blueprint.md\"}, \"success\": [\"A versioned policy schema rejects invalid limits and windows.\", \"Resolution produces exactly one effective policy for an organization.\", \"Request 101 is denied after 100 allowed requests in the same window.\", \"The denial returns a stable reason and emits matching decision telemetry.\"], \"summary\": \"For every organization request, resolve one effective rate-limit policy, deny request 101 when the effective limit is 100, and expose a stable reason plus decision telemetry without changing provider-owned metering.\", \"title\": \"Enforce organization-level request limits with visible decisions\"}, \"lane\": {\"id\": \"LANE-POLICY-CONTRACT\", \"name\": \"Policy contract lane\", \"owner\": \"platform-contracts\"}, \"leg\": {\"id\": \"LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID\", \"observable_state\": \"Rate-limit policy documents are schema-valid\", \"produces\": [\"validated policy document\"], \"proof\": \"Invalid limits and windows are rejected; required fields are machine-readable.\", \"requires\": []}, \"original_intake\": null, \"seam\": {\"consumes\": [\"authored organization policy\"], \"decision_ids\": [\"ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER\"], \"description\": \"Separates accepted policy shape from resolution and enforcement.\", \"evidence\": [\"E-BLUEPRINT\"], \"id\": \"SEAM-POLICY-CONTRACT\", \"independent_proof\": \"Invalid limits and windows fail schema validation deterministically.\", \"name\": \"Policy contract\", \"owner\": \"platform-contracts\", \"produces\": [\"validated policy document\"], \"rejected_alternatives\": [{\"alternative\": \"Treat the API handler as the policy boundary\", \"reason\": \"Handler ownership would mix contract, resolution, and enforcement concerns.\"}], \"responsibility\": \"Define and validate versioned organization rate-limit policy data.\"}}\n\n## Behavior\n\n- **B-1** — GIVEN a policy with a positive limit and window WHEN the document is validated THEN schema validation succeeds\n- **B-2** — GIVEN a policy with a zero limit or window WHEN the document is validated THEN schema validation fails\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n```bash\n# eval_1: The policy schema exists and parses as JSON\neval_1() {","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a39dbaa-00c7-486d-8b1c-1c3cd92be77f","uuid":"a80ee9aa-49d0-420e-b20a-9c5ff11f2a60","timestamp":"2026-09-14T22:10:32.530Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\nid: T-20260802-policy-schema\ntitle: \"Define the versioned rate-limit policy schema\"\nstatus: ready\nformat_version: 3\nprofile: standard\neffort: S\nbudget_iterations: 15\nagent: any\nparent: (none)\ndepends_on: []\nsupersedes: (none)\nprovenance: {\"contract\": \"TaskPlanProvenance/v1\", \"initiative\": \"rate-limit\", \"projection_digest\": \"5e6880a656be7cea80e5b6e4d881764fa82dcd46e456e34ebdf9f015ca910eda\", \"snapshot\": \"tasks/.plans/rate-limit/snapshots/5380b9e38bbed6d29dc11486834868e3c096f75f3ebfbdd7088e7f39b06ae655.json\", \"snapshot_digest\": \"5380b9e38bbed6d29dc11486834868e3c096f75f3ebfbdd7088e7f39b06ae655\"}\ntouches_paths: []\ncreates_paths: [src/rate_limit/policy.schema.json, tests/test_policy_schema.py]\nsource_note: \"tasks/.plans/rate-limit/legs/L